    <string name="deck_body">%1$d cards left to draw from.\n\nWhen it runs out, the discard pile is shuffled back into it and everything anybody had learned from watching that pile stops being worth anything — including what you learned. A round that is nearly out of deck is a round to call Vinto in.</string>
